{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"部族下","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"遼起松漠，經營撫納，竟有唐、晉帝王之器，典章文物施及潢海之區，作史者尚可以故俗語耶？舊史有部族志，歷代之所無也。古者，巡守于方岳，五服之君各述其職，遼之部族實似之。故以部族置宮衛、行營之後云。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"遼內四部族：","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"遙輦九帳族。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"橫帳三父房族。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"國舅帳拔里、乙室已族。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"國舅別部。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"太祖二十部，二國舅升帳分，止十八部。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"五院部。其先曰益古，凡六營。阻午可汗時，與弟撒里本領之，曰迭剌部。傳至太祖，以夷離菫即位。天贊元年，以強大難制，析五石烈為五院，六爪為六院，各置夷離菫。會同元年，更夷離菫為大王。部隸北府，以鎮南境。大王及都監春夏居五院部之側，秋冬居羊門甸。石烈四：","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"大蔑孤石烈。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"小蔑孤石烈。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"甌昆石烈。太宗會同二年，以烏古之地水草豐美，命居之。三年，益以海勒水之地為農田。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"乙習本石烈。會同二年，命以烏古之地。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"六院部。隸北府，以鎮南境。其大王及都監春夏居泰德泉之北，秋冬居獨盧金。石烈四：","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"轄懶石烈。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"阿速石烈。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"斡納撥石烈。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"斡納阿剌石烈。會同二年，命居烏古。三年，益以海勒水地。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"乙室部。其先曰撒里本，阻午可汗之世，與其兄益古分營而領之，曰乙室部。會同二年，更夷離菫為大王。隸南府，其大王及都監鎮駐西南之境，司徒居鴛鴦泊，閘撒狘居車軸山。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"阿里答石烈。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"欲主石烈。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"品部。其先曰拏女，阻午可汗以其營為部。太祖更諸部夷離菫為令穩。統和中，又改節度使。隸北府，屬西北路招討司，司徒居太子墳。凡戍軍隸節度使。留後戶隸司徒。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北哲里只石烈。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南轄懶石烈。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"楮特部。其先曰洼，阻午可汗以其營為部。隸南府，節度使屬西北路招討司，司徒居柏坡山及〈金畢〉山之側。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北石烈。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南石烈。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"烏隗部。其先曰撒里卜，與其兄涅勒同營，阻午可汗析為二：撒里卜為烏隗部，涅勒為涅剌部。俱隸北府，烏隗部節度使屬東北路招討司，司徒居徐母山、郝里河之側。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北石烈。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南石烈。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"涅剌部。其先曰涅勒，阻午可汗分其營為部。節度使屬西南路招討司，居黑山北，司徒居郝里河側。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北塌里石烈。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南察里石烈。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"突呂不部。其先曰塔古里，領三營。阻午可汗命分其一與弟航斡為突舉部；塔古里得其二，更為突呂不部。隸北府，節度使屬西北路招討司，司徒居長春州西。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北托不石烈。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南須石烈。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"突舉部。其先曰航斡，阻午可汗分營置部。隸南府，戍於隗烏古部，司徒居冗泉側。石烈二：","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北石烈。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南石烈。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"奚王府六部五帳分。其先曰時瑟，事東遙里十帳部主哲里。後逐哲里，自立為奚王。卒，弟吐勒斯立。遙輦鮮質可汗討之，俘其拒敵者七百戶，摭其降者。以時瑟鄰睦之故，止俘部曲之半，餘悉留焉。奚勢由是衰矣。初為五部：曰遙里，曰伯德，曰奧里，曰梅只，曰楚里。太祖盡降之，號五部奚。天贊二年，有東扒里冢胡損者，恃險堅壁於箭笴山以拒命，揶揄曰：「大軍何能為，我當飲墮瑰門下矣！」太祖滅之，以奚府給役戶，併括諸部隱丁，收合流散，置墮瑰部，因墮瑰門之語為名，遂號六部奚。命勃魯恩主之，仍號奚王。太宗即位，置宰相、常袞各二員。聖宗合奧里、梅只、墮瑰三部為一；特置二剋部以足六部之數。奚王和朔奴討兀惹，敗績，籍六部隸北府。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"突呂不室韋部。本名大、小二黃室韋戶。太祖為達馬狘沙里，以計降之，乃置為二部。隸北府，節度使屬東北路統軍司，戍泰州東北。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"涅剌拏古部。與突呂不室韋部同。節度使戍泰州東。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"迭剌迭達部。本鮮質可汗所俘奚七百戶，太祖即位，以為十四石烈，置為部。隸南府，節度使屬西南路招討司，戍黑山北，部民居慶州南。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"乙室奧隗部。神冊六年，太祖以所俘奚戶置。隸南府，節度使屬東北路兵馬司。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"楮特奧隗部。太祖以奚戶置。隸南府，節度使屬東京都部署司。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"品達魯虢部。太祖以所俘達魯虢部置。隸南府，節度使屬西南路招討司，戍黑山北。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"烏古涅剌部。亦曰涅離部。太祖取于骨里戶六千，神冊六年，析為烏古涅剌及圖魯二部。俱隸北府，節度使屬西南路招討司。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"圖魯部。節度使屬東北路統軍司。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"已上太祖以遙輦氏舊部族分置者凡十部，增置者八。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"聖宗三十四部：","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"撒里葛部。奚有三營：曰撒里葛，曰窈爪，曰耨碗爪。太祖伐奚，乞降，願為著帳子弟，籍于宮分，皆設夷離菫。聖宗各置為部，改設節度使，皆隸南府，以備畋獵之役。居澤州東。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"窈爪部。與撒里葛部同。居潭州南。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"耨碗爪部。節度使屬東京都部署司。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"訛僕括部。與撒里葛三部同。居望雲縣東。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"特里特勉部。初於八部各析二十戶以戍奚，偵候落馬河及速魯河側，置二十詳穩。聖宗以戶口蕃息，置為部，設節度使。隸南府，戍倒塌嶺，居橐駝岡。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"稍瓦部。初，取諸宮及橫帳大族奴隸置稍瓦石烈，「稍瓦」，鷹坊也，居遼水東，掌羅捕飛鳥。聖宗以戶口蕃息置部。節度使屬東京都部署司。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"曷朮部。初，取諸宮及橫帳大族奴隸置曷朮石烈，「曷朮」，鐵也，以冶于海濱柳濕河、三黜古斯、手山。聖宗以戶口蕃息置部。屬東京都部署司。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"遙里部。居潭、利二州間。石烈三：","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"撒里必石烈。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北石烈。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"帖魯石烈。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"伯德部。松山、平州之間，太師、太保居中京西。石烈六：","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"啜勒石烈。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"速古石烈。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"腆你石烈。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"迭里石烈。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"旭特石烈。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"悅里石烈。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"楚里部。居潭州北。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"奧里部。統和十二年，以與梅只、墮瑰三部民籍數寡，合為一部。并上三部，本屬奚王府，聖宗分置。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南剋部。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北剋部。統和十二年，以奚府二剋分置二部。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"隗衍突厥部。聖宗析四闢沙、四頗憊戶置，以鎮東北女直之境。開泰九年，節度使奏請置石烈。隸北府，屬黃龍府都部署司。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"奧衍突厥部。與隗衍突厥同。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"涅剌越兀部。以涅剌室韋戶置。隸北府，節度使屬西南面招討司，戍黑山北。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"奧衍女直部。聖宗以女直戶置。隸北府，節度使屬西北路招討司，戍鎮州境。自此至河西部，皆俘獲諸國之民。初隸諸宮，戶口蕃息置部。訖於五國，皆有節度使。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"乙典女直部。聖宗以女直戶置。隸南府，居高州北。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"斡突碗烏古部。聖宗以烏古戶置。隸南府，節度使屬西南面招討司，戍黑山北。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"迭魯敵烈部。聖宗以敵烈戶置。隸北府，節度使屬烏古敵烈統軍司。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"室韋部。聖宗以室韋戶置。隸北府，節度使屬西北路招討司。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"朮哲達魯虢部。聖宗以達魯虢戶置。隸北府，節度使屬東北路統軍司，戍境內，居境外。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"梅古悉部。聖宗以唐古戶置。隸北府，節度使屬西南面招討司。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"頡的部。聖宗以唐古戶置。隸北府，節度使屬西南面招討司。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北敵烈部。聖宗以敵烈戶置。戍隗烏古部。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"匿訖唐古部。聖宗置。隸北府，節度使屬西南面招討司。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"北唐古部。聖宗以唐古戶置。隸北府，節度使屬黃龍府都部署司，戍府南。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"南唐古部。聖宗置。隸北府。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"鶴剌唐古部。與南唐古同。節度使屬西南面招討司。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"河西部。聖宗置。隸北府，節度使屬東北路統軍司。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"薛特部。開泰四年，以回鶻戶置。隸北府，居慈仁縣北。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"伯斯鼻骨德部。本鼻骨德戶。初隸諸宮，聖宗以戶口蕃息置部。隸北府，節度使屬東北路統軍司，戍境內，居境外。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"達馬鼻骨德部。聖宗以鼻骨德戶置。隸南府，節度使屬東北路統軍司。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"五國部。剖阿里國、盆奴里國、奧里米國、越里篤國、越里吉國，聖宗時來附，命居本土，以鎮東北境，屬黃龍府都部署司。重熙六年，以越里吉國人尚海等訴酋帥渾敝貪污，罷五國酋帥，設節度使以領之。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"已上聖宗以舊部族置者十六，增置十八。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"遼國外十部：","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"烏古部。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"敵烈八部。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"隗古部。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"回跋部。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"嵓母部。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"吾禿婉部。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"迭剌葛部。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"回鶻部。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"長白山部。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"蒲盧毛朵部。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_33_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_33","textTraditional":"右十部不能成國，附庸於遼，時叛時服，各有職貢，猶唐人之有羈縻州也。","sentenceOrder":106}],"overrides":{}}